  <description><![CDATA[<link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="https://quickmap.dot.ca.gov/css/gm-infowindow.css?v=9" />
<div class="infowindow-content">
    <div class="iw-header">
        <div class="iw-header-left">
            <img class="iw-icon" src="https://quickmap.dot.ca.gov/img/v2/CaltransHighwayInfo.png?v=4" />
            Caltrans Highway Information
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="iw-body">
        <h2 class="iw-title">Westbound Interstate 80 NYACK, WB ON FR</h2>
        
        <p class="iw-text">WESTBOUND INTERSTATE 80 IN PLACER COUNTY  JUST WEST OF NYACK BIG RIGS ARE REQUIRED TO STOP AT THE DESIGNATED BRAKE CHECK AREA IN MOUNTAINOUS TERRAIN.FAILURE TO STOP MAY RESULT IN CHP ENFORCEMENT ACTION, INCLUDING CITATIONS AND ORDERED INSPECTIONS.CONDUCT MANDATORY BRAKE CHECKS AND MAKE NECESSARY ADJUSTMENTS BEFORE CONTINUING DOWNGRADE.THIS CHECKPOINT IS CRITICAL AND CAN PREVENT BRAKE FAILURE, BRAKE FIRES, WILDFIRES, AND MAJOR TRUCK COLLISIONS.COMPLIANCE IS NOT OPTIONAL SAFETY IS OUR PRIORITY.</p>
        
        <div font-size:xx-small;'>District: 3 Message ID: 145529</div>

        <p class="iw-attribution">
            Information courtesy of <strong>Caltrans</strong>
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="iw-footer">
        <span class="iw-timestamp">Last updated: <strong>11/18/2026</strong> 2:09pm</span>
    </div>
</div>]]></description>
